
# UDP-Lite: a UDP variant (RFC 3828) where the checksum covers only a prefix of the datagram, so partially damaged
# payloads still reach the application. The `checksum-coverage` field replaces UDP's `length`.

form udp-lite-datagram
  link source-port, like u16
  link destination-port, like u16
  link checksum-coverage, like u16
  link checksum, like u16
  link payload, like list
